he refused run leaves the cache byte-identical.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `TASK-260720-1nlmvv_implementation-notes-cycle-2.md` — finding-by-finding delta\n- `TASK-260720-1nlmvv_gate-evidence-cycle-2-continuation.md` — gate report incl. freshness proof\n- `TASK-260720-1nlmvv_gate-evidence-cycle-2.tar.gz` — raw logs + runner script\n- Logbook `2026-07-29 0554` — corrupt-cache unrecoverability root cause, the unattributable cache key, the marker-refusal split, the report-vs-verdict decision, plus the ENOSPC / PowerShell `-test.run` / test-timeout traps for whoever wires CI\n\nNothing staged, committed, or published — worktree and main checkout both clean of stage.","ttft_ms":2414,"ttft_stream_ms":1925,"time_to_request_ms":71,"type":"result","duration_ms":1716528,"uuid":"ba614e1a-84f7-45bc-83ea-32b06f8f8c8c"}
